---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout locale="zh-CN" title="AI vs Google 搜索 — Luxon Learn" description="为什么给 AI 更多背景信息，结果会好很多。">
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/legacy-shared.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/learn/learn-styles.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/chat-story.css" />
  </Fragment>

  <!-- Lesson Hero — Chapter Headline -->
  <section class="lesson-hero">
    <div class="lesson-breadcrumb">
      <a href="/zh-CN/learn">Learn</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <span>第 1 课</span>
    </div>
    <div class="lesson-chapter-box">
      <div class="lesson-chapter-box__badge">入门</div>
      <h1>AI vs Google 搜索</h1>
      <p class="lesson-chapter-box__sub">为什么给 AI 更多背景信息，结果会好很多。</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Chat Story -->
  <div class="chat-story" role="region" aria-label="Interactive lesson">

    <!-- Act 1: The Google Habit -->
    <div class="chat-story__group">
      <div class="chat-story__bubble chat-story__bubble--user">
        <div class="chat-story__avatar chat-story__avatar--user">L</div>
        <div>
          <div class="chat-story__meta chat-story__meta--user">
            <span class="chat-story__label">You</span>
            <span class="chat-story__time">10:02 AM</span>
          </div>
          <div class="chat-story__bubble-inner">电车比较</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="chat-story__typing">
        <div class="chat-story__avatar chat-story__avatar--ai">Lx</div>
        <div class="chat-story__typing-dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="chat-story__bubble chat-story__bubble--ai">
        <div class="chat-story__avatar chat-story__avatar--ai">Lx</div>
        <div>
          <div class="chat-story__meta">
            <span class="chat-story__label">AI</span>
            <span class="chat-story__time">10:02 AM</span>
          </div>
          <div class="chat-story__bubble-inner">好的！以下是市面上热门的电动车：<br><br>🚗 Tesla Model 3 — 约 HK$280k 起<br>🚗 BYD Atto 3 — 约 HK$190k 起<br>🚗 BMW iX3 — 约 HK$380k 起<br>🚗 Hyundai Ioniq 5 — 约 HK$300k 起<br><br>需要我比较特定型号吗？</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Narration -->
    <div class="chat-story__narration is-visible">
      <p><strong>大多数人就是这样跟 AI 对话。</strong>短短几个关键词。像 Google 搜索一样。结果 AI 给你的……跟 Google 搜索结果一样。泛泛的。没错 — 但没用。</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Act 2: The Right Way -->
    <div class="chat-story__group">
      <div class="chat-story__divider">
        <span class="chat-story__divider-text">再试一次</span>
      </div>
      <div class="chat-story__bubble chat-story__bubble--user">
        <div class="chat-story__avatar chat-story__avatar--user">L</div>
        <div>
          <div class="chat-story__meta chat-story__meta--user">
            <span class="chat-story__label">You</span>
            <span class="chat-story__time">10:05 AM</span>
          </div>
          <div class="chat-story__bubble-inner">我在香港想比较家庭用电动车，一家四口。预算 HK$300k。需要放得下两辆婴儿车的后备箱。喜欢白色。主要市区行驶，偶尔去深圳。有什么好选择？</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="chat-story__typing">
        <div class="chat-story__avatar chat-story__avatar--ai">Lx</div>
        <div class="chat-story__typing-dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="chat-story__bubble chat-story__bubble--ai">
        <div class="chat-story__avatar chat-story__avatar--ai">Lx</div>
        <div>
          <div class="chat-story__meta">
            <span class="chat-story__label">AI</span>
            <span class="chat-story__time">10:05 AM</span>
          </div>
          <div class="chat-story__bubble-inner">根据你的情况，我建议以下几款：<br><br>🥇 <strong>BYD Seal</strong> — HK$259k，540L 后备箱（放得下两辆婴儿车），有白色，市区加跨境充电网络完善<br><br>🥈 <strong>Tesla Model 3 Highland</strong> — HK$265k，682L 后备箱，Supercharger 遍布香港加深圳，有白色<br><br>🥉 <strong>Hyundai Ioniq 5</strong> — HK$299k，531L 后备箱，V2L 可以在深圳出行中给电器供电<br><br>需要我比较这三款的保险费用或贬值率吗？</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Narration: The Formula -->
    <div class="chat-story__narration is-visible">
      <p>同一个问题。一个是<strong>3 个词</strong>。另一个是<strong>3 句话</strong>。第二个答案有用 10 倍。秘诀？<strong>任务 + 背景信息。</strong></p>
    </div>

    <!-- Act 3: Work Email Example -->
    <div class="chat-story__group">
      <div class="chat-story__divider">
        <span class="chat-story__divider-text">工作中犯同样的错误</span>
      </div>
      <div class="chat-story__bubble chat-story__bubble--user">
        <div class="chat-story__avatar chat-story__avatar--user">L</div>
        <div>
          <div class="chat-story__meta chat-story__meta--user">
            <span class="chat-story__label">You</span>
            <span class="chat-story__time">2:30 PM</span>
          </div>
          <div class="chat-story__bubble-inner">写封邮件关于延迟的货运</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="chat-story__typing">
        <div class="chat-story__avatar chat-story__avatar--ai">Lx</div>
        <div class="chat-story__typing-dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="chat-story__bubble chat-story__bubble--ai">
        <div class="chat-story__avatar chat-story__avatar--ai">Lx</div>
        <div>
          <div class="chat-story__meta">
            <span class="chat-story__label">AI</span>
            <span class="chat-story__time">2:30 PM</span>
          </div>
          <div class="chat-story__bubble-inner">很乐意帮你！能否告诉我：<br><br>• 收件人是谁？<br>• 延迟了什么，为什么？<br>• 新的时间表是怎样的？<br>• 你想要什么语气 — 正式、友好、紧急？</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="chat-story__narration is-visible">
      <p>AI 正在问它需要的问题。但你已经知道答案了。<strong>为什么不一次性全部给出？</strong></p>
    </div>

    <!-- Act 4: The Complete Version -->
    <div class="chat-story__group">
      <div class="chat-story__divider">
        <span class="chat-story__divider-text">正确的写法</span>
      </div>
      <div class="chat-story__bubble chat-story__bubble--user">
        <div class="chat-story__avatar chat-story__avatar--user">L</div>
        <div>
          <div class="chat-story__meta chat-story__meta--user">
            <span class="chat-story__label">You</span>
            <span class="chat-story__time">2:35 PM</span>
          </div>
          <div class="chat-story__bubble-inner">写封邮件给我的深圳供应商，关于延迟的货运。货柜原定上个星期五到，现在他们说下星期三。我们的仓库在屯门。语气：坚定但专业。要求解释和更新预计到达时间。CC 我们的物流经理 David。</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="chat-story__typing">
        <div class="chat-story__avatar chat-story__avatar--ai">Lx</div>
        <div class="chat-story__typing-dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="chat-story__bubble chat-story__bubble--ai">
        <div class="chat-story__avatar chat-story__avatar--ai">Lx</div>
        <div>
          <div class="chat-story__meta">
            <span class="chat-story__label">AI</span>
            <span class="chat-story__time">2:35 PM</span>
          </div>
          <div class="chat-story__bubble-inner">搞定了。草稿如下：<br><br>---<br><br>致 [供应商名称]：<br><br>我们注意到原定 4 月 11 日到达的货柜 [编号]，已经在没有事先通知的情况下改为 4 月 16 日。<br><br>由于此延迟影响我们的交付承诺，希望贵公司能解释修订后的时间表，并确认 4 月 16 日的新预计到达时间是确定的。<br><br>我们的仓库位于屯门 — 请确保送货预约已反映此信息。<br><br>期待贵公司的迅速回复。<br><br>此致<br>[你的名称]<br><br>---<br><br>需要我调整语气或补充什么吗？</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Narration: Constraints -->
    <div class="chat-story__narration is-visible">
      <p>每个好的提示都有两部分：<strong>你想做什么</strong>和<strong>AI 需要知道什么</strong>。预算、时间表、对象、语气、格式 — 这些筛选条件将一个泛泛的答案变成一个有用的答案。</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Act 5: Constraint Example -->
    <div class="chat-story__group">
      <div class="chat-story__divider">
        <span class="chat-story__divider-text">限制条件改变一切</span>
      </div>
      <div class="chat-story__bubble chat-story__bubble--user">
        <div class="chat-story__avatar chat-story__avatar--user">L</div>
        <div>
          <div class="chat-story__meta chat-story__meta--user">
            <span class="chat-story__label">You</span>
            <span class="chat-story__time">4:10 PM</span>
          </div>
          <div class="chat-story__bubble-inner">总结这个会议</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="chat-story__typing">
        <div class="chat-story__avatar chat-story__avatar--ai">Lx</div>
        <div class="chat-story__typing-dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="chat-story__bubble chat-story__bubble--ai">
        <div class="chat-story__avatar chat-story__avatar--ai">Lx</div>
        <div>
          <div class="chat-story__meta">
            <span class="chat-story__label">AI</span>
            <span class="chat-story__time">4:10 PM</span>
          </div>
          <div class="chat-story__bubble-inner">以下是会议总结……<br><br>[一个 500 字的总结，所有内容平均讲述，因为你没告诉 AI 什么重要]</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="chat-story__bubble chat-story__bubble--user" style="margin-top: 24px;">
        <div class="chat-story__avatar chat-story__avatar--user">L</div>
        <div>
          <div class="chat-story__meta chat-story__meta--user">
            <span class="chat-story__label">You</span>
            <span class="chat-story__time">4:12 PM</span>
          </div>
          <div class="chat-story__bubble-inner">用 3 个要点总结这个会议。集中讲行动项目和截止日期。这个是给没出席的老板看的 — 控制在 150 字以内。</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="chat-story__typing">
        <div class="chat-story__avatar chat-story__avatar--ai">Lx</div>
        <div class="chat-story__typing-dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="chat-story__bubble chat-story__bubble--ai">
        <div class="chat-story__avatar chat-story__avatar--ai">Lx</div>
        <div>
          <div class="chat-story__meta">
            <span class="chat-story__label">AI</span>
            <span class="chat-story__time">4:12 PM</span>
          </div>
          <div class="chat-story__bubble-inner"><strong>会议总结 — 4 月 13 日</strong><br><br>• <strong>Q2 出货目标确认：</strong>6 月 30 日前 200 个货柜。David 星期五前敲定路线。<br><br>• <strong>新供应商加入：</strong>深圳 FastLogistics 获批香港路线。下星期试行。<br><br>• <strong>价格检讨：</strong>主要承运商提出加价要求 — 需于 4 月 20 日前决定。<br><br>95 字。可以直接转发。</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Tip -->
    <div class="lesson-tip">
      <div class="lesson-tip__icon">💡</div>
      <div class="lesson-tip__text"><strong>不妨试试：</strong>打开你的 AI，先问你平时会问的问题。然后加多 3 倍背景再问一次。对比两个答案，差别会很大。</div>
    </div>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="lesson-cta">
      <h3>需要我们帮你设置吗？</h3>
      <p>我们为你配置一切 — 个性化设置、项目和工作流程 — 一次搞定。</p>
      <a href="https://wa.me/85297381028" class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">预约安装</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Lesson Nav -->
  <div class="lesson-nav">
    <span></span>
    <a href="/zh-CN/learn/lesson-2" class="next">先建立一个项目 <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="16" height="16"><path d="M5 12h14m-7-7 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
  </div>

  <script is:inline src="/chat-story.js"></script>
</BaseLayout>
